//
// Bytewise correctness for multi-clone batch-fanout ELFs (Phase A.1).
//
// For each (variant, n_clones) in conv/build_x1_mc._FANOUT, dispatches
// the fanout ELF once with one shared weight + N distinct inputs and
// compares each per-clone output against the x1 single-sub ELF for the
// same variant run N times. PASS = bytewise identical.
//
// Both the fanout ELF and its x1 counterpart are built on demand into
// MDV6_BUILD_DIR/build_merged/.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, torch
//
// RUN: rm -rf test_stx
// RUN: mkdir -p test_stx
// RUN: cd test_stx
//
// RUN: env MDV6_BUILD_DIR=. %run_on_npu2% python3 %S/conv/test_fanout.py --variant all
